comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-03T11:09:27.269Z","harness:codex","Estimate basis 2026-08-03: 360 minutes covers resolver outcome algebra, bounded reason codes, immutable recording, health projection, zero-success warning logic, and negative controls."
  "2026-08-08T22:13:20.575Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-09: active in the coupled context-provenance tranche with pm-3zgh2c, pm-eq9dlw, pm-lu6sca, pm-b1w8vr, and pm-h75tjh. Scope is SDK-first provenance inference and resolver outcomes, typed role domains, stable entity read-back projections, and epoch-aware release classification; all other open items remain unclaimed."
  "2026-08-08T22:32:58.636Z","harness:codex","Design evidence: resolver attempts are counted only when the resolver input exists. Missing AI_AGENT or session identifiers are harness_unavailable; a supplied valid resolver input that yields no value is resolver_failed. pm health scans at most 10,000 immutable events, tolerates malformed streams owned by integrity diagnostics, and emits advisory zero-success warnings."
  "2026-08-08T23:34:23.599Z","harness:codex","Tranche pause: resolver failure versus harness-unavailable outcomes and zero-success health warning landed, but the public outcome domain still needs an explicit no-resolver-declared state before this feature meets all four acceptance categories."
  "2026-08-09T00:09:13.766Z","harness:codex","Broad tranche evidence: resolver attempts now distinguish resolved, failed, harness-unavailable, and probes-disabled outcomes; attempted failures are persisted privacy-safely and aggregated by health. The complete 7086-test 100/100/100/100 gate passes. Item remains open and unclaimed because the explicit no-resolver-declared outcome remains to be implemented."
  "2026-08-09T00:20:23.262Z","harness:codex","Delivery handoff: broad SDK/CLI tranche committed at 5b36abc75 and opened as GitHub PR #944 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/944). Exact local evidence includes 7,086 tests across 461 files at 100/100/100/100 coverage, package/compatibility/npx/dogfood/manual acceptance, tracker/changelog/SDK/static-quality gates, and zero current dependency or GitHub security alerts. Review and exact-head CI evidence will be appended after the hosted loop."
  "2026-08-09T00:58:13.326Z","harness:codex","Review-loop evidence: provenance scanning now byte-bounds history before allocation, parses only complete lines, distinguishes exact event limits from truncation, suppresses zero-success warnings on incomplete samples, and records invalid explicit role values as invalid_value with argv precedence. Full sandboxed gate: 461 files, 7,089 tests, exact 100/100/100/100. Item remains open and unclaimed for its documented no-resolver-declared residual."
  "2026-08-09T01:24:46.237Z","harness:codex","PR #944 hosted evidence for the completed tranche portion: implementation commit b6678b8 passed all deterministic checks; CodeRabbit confirmed byte-bounded complete-event health semantics and invalid-value role outcomes. All 16 findings are addressed, replied to, and resolved. Item stays open and unclaimed for the documented no-resolver-declared residual."
  "2026-08-09T15:57:25.224Z","harness:codex","Evidence: focused agent-runtime and author-attribution tests passed after truthful overlapping-run failure receipts; the final uninterrupted full suite passed 7,100/7,100 with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. SDK surface change was explicitly acknowledged and all static, lint, parity, token, and performance gates passed."
